  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "statement": "In rectangle \\(A B C D\\) with area 1 , point \\(M\\) is selected on \\(\\overline{A B}\\) and points \\(X, Y\\) are selected on \\(\\overline{C D}\\) such that \\(A X<A Y\\). Suppose that \\(A M=B M\\). Given that the area of triangle \\(M X Y\\) is \\(\\frac{1}{2014}\\), compute the area of trapezoid \\(A X Y B\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
